# runtime scratch: raw bytes, caches, logs, probe workdirs, downloaded binaries
raw/
cache/
node_modules/
*.log
.verify/
bin/

# the published outputs in out/ ARE committed on purpose (that is what CI serves)

# except the local-pick results: 那是「这台机器上此刻能用」的个人优选结果，
# 与仓库内容无关，也不该混进每一次 CI 刷新里。
out/local.yaml
out/local-nodes.txt
out/local-report.json

# tier2（大陆实测）只作为 release 资产发布，不提交：它依赖那台机器，
# 提交进仓库会让 out/ 里的文件互相矛盾。
out/nodepool-cn.yaml
out/cn-report.json
